sentences.t:
“Ego te, quae plurima fando
enumerare vales, numquam, regina, negabo
promeritam;

sentences.l:
“I you, things which, very many, by speaking
you are able to list, never, queen, will deny
to have deserved;

sentences.t:
Me patris Anchisae, quotiens umentibus umbris
nox operit terras, quotiens astra ignea surgunt,
admonet in somnis et turbida terret imago;

sentences.l:
Me my father Anchises', whenever with dewy shadows
night covers the earth, whenever the stars fiery rise,
warns in sleep and, troubled, frightens, the image;

sentences.t:
Nunc etiam interpres divom, Iove missus ab ipso—
testor utrumque caput—celeris mandata per auras
detulit;

sentences.l:
Now even the interpreter of the gods, by Jove sent himself —
I call to witness each head — swift the commands through the breezes
has brought down;
